<title>INDIA: Citibank arranges $8 mln for India Lakshmi Machine.</title>
<headline>Citibank arranges $8 mln for India Lakshmi Machine.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank International Plc has arranged a $8 million syndicated Euroloan for Lakshmi Machine Works, the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The loan structured at 60 basis points over Libor with a bullet repayment of three years will be used by the company to finance imports of capital equipment, it said.</p>
<p>Citibank said it had arranged in December 1995 a similar $8 million loan for the firm on the same conditions.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
